  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/18RsKn1.png\" width=\"1152\" height=\"660\"><strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/cwqwNx3TGE\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/574476444366012420?label=Discord&amp;color=252a36&amp;labelColor=5865F2&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"202\" height=\"28\"></a></strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/mandalacreations\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=mandalacreations&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;color=252A36&amp;labelColor=FF424D&amp;logoColor=FFFFFF\" width=\"196\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://twitter.com/CesarZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/follow-@cesarzorak-white?label=follow&amp;color=252a36&amp;labelColor=1D9BF0&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=twitter&amp;logoColor=white\" width=\"213\" height=\"28\"></a></strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SU3whMm.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1200\" height=\"34\"></a></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>關於：</strong></span><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fZorak\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br></a></p><p>Mandala GUI 是一款優雅的介面主題，風格源自 Mandala Creations。<br>專為喜愛深色模式的使用者設計。<br>僅改變 Minecraft 的 UI，不影響物品或方塊。</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>特色：</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li>深色模式 UI。</li>\n<li>扁平且現代的配色。</li>\n<li>藍灰色調色盤。</li>\n<li>兼容多款模組（模組清單詳見檔案描述）。</li>\n</ul><p><span><strong><span style=\"color:#f60\">模組支援與替代紋理</span></strong> 將轉移至 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/mandalas-gui-add-ons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mandala's GUI - Add-Ons</a> [需一段時間才能完全轉移所有附加內容]。 ❤</span></p><p